The HAT spatial backbone (oss/sr/v6/hat.py) is an independent reimplementation
of Chen et al., "Activating More Pixels in Image Super-Resolution Transformer"
(CVPR 2023). The original reference implementation is Apache-2.0 licensed.

Other prior-art references (GSASR, AAA-Gaussians, AA-2DGS, vk_gaussian_splatting,
GaussianVideo, etc.) are cited in BIBLIOGRAPHY.md and integrated as design
inspiration only — no code from those projects is included verbatim.
